@startuml
title Cyber AI - Admin Dashboard Sequence

actor Admin
participant "AdminDashboard" as UI
participant "useAuth.ts" as Auth
participant "API Routes" as API
database "Supabase DB" as DB

== Access admin view ==
Admin -> UI : open admin dashboard
UI -> Auth : isAdmin()
Auth -> DB : SELECT role FROM profiles WHERE id = auth.uid()
DB --> Auth : role = 'admin'
Auth --> UI : true
UI --> Admin : show Admin dashboard

== Load user list ==
UI -> API : GET /api/admin/users
API -> DB : list users + profiles
DB --> API : users
API --> UI : { users }
UI --> Admin : render users table

== Search / filter users ==
Admin -> UI : type in search box
UI -> UI : filter users locally (useMemo)
UI --> Admin : show filtered results

== Change role ==
Admin -> UI : select role from dropdown
UI -> API : PATCH /api/admin/users\nbody: { userId, role }
API -> DB : UPDATE profiles SET role = ...\nUPDATE auth.users app_metadata
DB --> API : ok
API --> UI : { ok: true }
UI --> Admin : show success toast

== Delete user ==
Admin -> UI : click Delete / confirm
UI -> API : DELETE /api/admin/users\nbody: { userId }
API -> DB : DELETE FROM auth.users WHERE id = ...
DB --> API : ok
API --> UI : { ok: true }
UI --> Admin : remove from list + toast

== Load user queries ==
Admin -> UI : switch to Queries tab
UI -> API : GET /api/admin/queries?page=&perPage=&q=&source=
API -> DB : SELECT FROM user_queries\nORDER created_at DESC
DB --> API : rows
API --> UI : { queries }
UI --> Admin : render queries table

== Filter / search queries ==
Admin -> UI : type query search or change source
UI -> UI : reload with new query params
UI -> API : GET /api/admin/queries?q=...&source=...
API -> DB : filtered rows
DB --> API : rows
API --> UI : { queries }
UI --> Admin : show filtered results

== Back to chat ==
Admin -> UI : click Back to chat
UI -> Auth : onBackToChat()
Auth --> Admin : show Chat workspace

@enduml
